#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:5
msgid "Distributed Inference"
msgstr "Inferencia distribuida"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:6
msgid ""
"Some language models including **DeepSeek V3**, **DeepSeek R1**, etc are too"
" large to fit into GPus on a single machine, Xinference supported running "
"these models across multiple machines."
msgstr ""
"Algunos modelos de lenguaje, incluyendo **DeepSeek V3**, **DeepSeek R1**, "
"entre otros, son demasiado grandes para adaptarse a una GPU en una sola "
"máquina. Xinference admite la ejecución de estos modelos en múltiples "
"máquinas."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:13
msgid "Supported Engines"
msgstr "Motores compatibles"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:14
msgid "Now, Xinference supported below engines to run models across workers."
msgstr ""
"Ahora, Xinference admite los siguientes motores para ejecutar modelos en "
"varios workers."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:16
msgid ":ref:`SGLang <sglang_backend>` (supported in v1.3.0)"
msgstr ":ref:`SGLang <sglang_backend>` (soporta en v1.3.0)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:17
msgid ":ref:`vLLM <vllm_backend>` (supported in v1.4.1)"
msgstr ":ref:`vLLM <vllm_backend>` (compatible desde v1.4.1)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:18
msgid ""
":ref:`MLX <mlx_backend>` (supported in v1.7.1), MLX distributed currently "
"does not support all models. The following model types are supported at this"
" time. If you have additional requirements, feel free to submit a GitHub "
"issue at `https://github.com/xorbitsai/inference/issues "
"<https://github.com/xorbitsai/inference/issues>`_ to request support."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MLX <mlx_backend>` (soportado desde v1.7.1) actualmente no admite "
"todos los modelos en modo distribuido. Por ahora, se soportan los siguientes"
" tipos de modelos. Si tienes otras necesidades, no dudes en enviar un issue "
"en `https://github.com/xorbitsai/inference/issues "
"<https://github.com/xorbitsai/inference/issues>`_ para solicitar soporte."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:22
msgid "DeepSeek v3 and R1"
msgstr "DeepSeek v3 y R1"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:23
msgid "Qwen2.5-instruct and the models have the same model architectures."
msgstr "Qwen2.5-instruct y otros modelos con la misma arquitectura."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:24
msgid "Qwen3 and the models have the same model architectures."
msgstr "Qwen3 y otros modelos con la misma arquitectura de modelo."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:25
