msgstr "Qwen3-moe y otros modelos con la misma arquitectura de modelo."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:30
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Usar"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:31
msgid ""
"First you need at least 2 workers to support distributed inference. Refer to"
" :ref:`running Xinference in cluster <distributed_getting_started>` to "
"create a Xinference cluster including supervisor and workers."
msgstr ""
"Primero necesita al menos 2 workers para admitir inferencia distribuida. "
"Consulte :ref:`ejecutar Xinference en clúster "
"<distributed_getting_started>` para crear un clúster de Xinference que "
"incluya supervisor y workers."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:35
msgid ""
"vLLM V1 (v0.11.1+) supports tensor parallelism (TP) and pipeline parallelism"
" (PP) through Xinference's xoscar executor. For a model spanning workers, "
"the defaults are ``tensor_parallel_size`` = GPUs per worker and "
"``pipeline_parallel_size`` = worker count."
msgstr ""
"vLLM V1 (v0.11.1+) admite paralelismo tensorial (TP) y paralelismo de "
"pipeline (PP) mediante el ejecutor xoscar de Xinference. Para un modelo "
"distribuido entre workers, ``tensor_parallel_size`` equivale por defecto al "
"número de GPU por worker y ``pipeline_parallel_size`` al número de workers."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:39
msgid ""
"For example, two workers with four GPUs each use ``--n-worker 2 --n-gpu 4``,"
" ``tensor_parallel_size=4`` and ``pipeline_parallel_size=2``. Explicit TP/PP"
" settings must satisfy ``TP * PP = total allocated GPUs``. Each worker must "
"allocate the same GPU count, and the model architecture must support vLLM "
"PP."
msgstr ""
"Por ejemplo, dos workers con cuatro GPU cada uno utilizan ``--n-worker 2 "
"--n-gpu 4``, ``tensor_parallel_size=4`` y ``pipeline_parallel_size=2``. Los "
"ajustes explícitos de TP/PP deben cumplir ``TP * PP = total allocated "
"GPUs``: su producto debe ser igual al número total de GPU asignadas. Cada "
"worker debe tener el mismo número de GPU asignadas y la arquitectura del "
"modelo debe admitir vLLM PP."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:44
msgid ""
"This PP deployment does not require a Ray cluster. Xavier V1 and native NIXL"
" P/D separation currently require ``TP=1`` and ``PP=1`` and cannot be "
"combined with this configuration."
msgstr ""
"Este despliegue de PP no requiere un clúster Ray. Xavier V1 y la separación "
"P/D nativa de NIXL requieren actualmente ``TP=1`` y ``PP=1`` y no se pueden "
"combinar con esta configuración."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:47
msgid ""
"Then if are using web UI, choose expected machines for ``worker count`` in "
"the optional configurations, if you are using command line, add ``--n-worker"
" <machine number>`` when launching a model. The model will be launched "
"across multiple workers accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Luego, si usa la interfaz web, seleccione las máquinas esperadas para "
"``worker count`` en las configuraciones opcionales; si usa la línea de "
"comandos, agregue ``--n-worker <número de máquina>`` al iniciar el modelo. "
"El modelo se desplegará en varios workers según corresponda."

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed_inference.rst:55
msgid ""
"``GPU count`` on web UI, or ``--n-gpu`` for command line now mean GPUs count"
" per worker if you are using distributed inference."
msgstr ""
"``GPU count`` en la interfaz web, o ``--n-gpu`` en la línea de comandos, "
"ahora indican el número de GPUs por worker si está usando inferencia "
"distribuida."
